 * sit with Adam's four (2026-08-29), in the same vocabulary — heavy round
 * strokes at the traces' weight, wobble, chunky dots, no face. The blanket
 * carries the ode as squiggle-writing; the cold clay hog-dart pokes out the
 * left, tucked in.
 */
